{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Sangue del mio sangue (Blood of my Blood)","Federico, un giovane uomo d’armi, viene sedotto come il suo gemello prete da suor Benedetta che verrà condannata ad essere murata viva nelle antiche prigioni di Bobbio. Nello stesso luogo, secoli dopo, tornerà un altro Federico, sedicente ispettore ministeriale, che scoprirà che l’edificio è ancora abitato da un misterioso Conte, che vive solo di notte. (Just like his twin priest, Federico - a young man-at-arms - is seduced by Sister Benedetta, who is condemned to be walled up alive in the ancient prison of Bobbio. Centuries later, another Federico, self-declared ministerial inspector, comes back to the same place. He discovers that the building is still inhabited by a mysterious lord who comes alive only during the night.)",[4,5],"natural","state institutions",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":60,"media":63,"synopsis":66,"production":69,"characters":77,"roles":92,"awards":140,"tags":3},"Film","IT2015_036","it2015-036-sangue-del-mio-sangue",{"native":11,"english":12},"Sangue del mio sangue","Blood of my Blood",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2015-09-09",2015,"Fiction film",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Marco Bellocchio","marco-bellocchio",1939,0,"Male identifying","Italy",[27,36,43,49,55],{"film":28,"year":32,"award":33,"category":34,"result":35},{"slug":29,"title":30},"it2016-028-fai-bei-sogni",{"native":31},"Fai bei sogni",2017,"Premio David di Donatello","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":37,"year":41,"award":33,"category":34,"result":42},{"slug":38,"title":39},"it2019-008-il-traditore",{"native":40},"Il traditore",2020,"Awarded",{"film":44,"year":48,"award":33,"category":34,"result":42},{"slug":45,"title":46},"it2022-015-esterno-notte-parte-1",{"native":47},"Esterno Notte",20